# the dent at the parameters of Theorem LU at delta = 1/2, round 1: a play x at whitened distance a = |x - m|_M from m (Euclidean s = a r0/sqrt(d+2)), in any direction; mean and standard deviation of D(x; theta)/g over theta ~ Pi_1 (uniform on r0 B in R^d), by quadrature (sd exactly 0 where h <= 0 on the whole range of the quadrature); q_over_g = bowl at x / g; sd_over_sigma = standard deviation of the observation's mean over the tips, in units of the noise sigma; info_bound = Var/(2 sigma^2), the bound of Lemma chain (i) with no ripe cell; sd_tail_bound = what the ranges left out by the quadrature can add to sd_over_g
a s mean_over_g sd_over_g q_over_g sd_over_sigma info_bound sd_tail_bound
